# Local Debian/Ubuntu test-build artifacts (scripts/deb-build.sh output).
.deb-out/

# Vendored Rust source tarballs (scripts/rust-vendor-tarball.sh output, ~16 MB).
# Build artifacts: they are published as GitHub release assets and every lane
# pulls them from there by URL -- this repo holds the recipe, never the payload.
# The script is reproducible, so the tarball can be rebuilt byte-for-byte from
# the upstream tag whenever it is needed.
*-vendored.tar.xz
